---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FundingTable from '../components/FundingTable.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Support Us | SMS PTO" description="Help the Sharon Middle School PTO fund teacher resources, enrichment programs, student opportunities, and community-building events." current="support">
  <section class="support-hero">
    <div class="container support-hero-grid">
      <img src="/images/enrichment-science.avif" alt="SMS science enrichment program" />
      <div class="support-copy">
        <h1 class="display-title">Invest in the SMS Experience</h1>
        <p class="lead">We help fund teacher resources, enrichment programs, student opportunities, and community-building events that enhance the middle school experience.</p>
        <p>We are aiming to raise $45,000 for the upcoming school year. Every donation helps make a difference. The SMS PTO is a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="support-enrichment">
    <div class="container enrichment-grid">
      <h2 class="section-title">Help Fund Next Year's Enrichment Programs</h2>
      <div>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="#matching">Get a Corporate Matching Gift</a>
          <a class="button" href="#membership">Get a PTO Membership</a>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">Programs such as <a href="https://www.theatreespresso.org">Theater Espresso</a> and <a href="https://www.crocodilerivermusic.org/our-programs">Crocodile River Music</a> provide engaging experiences that expose students to new ideas, perspectives, and cultures beyond the traditional classroom. The cost to bring these enrichment opportunities to all grades is approximately $10,000–$15,000, with individual programs ranging from $3,000–$5,000 or more.</p>
        <p>With your support, we can continue offering these valuable experiences and ensure that every student benefits from meaningful enrichment opportunities throughout the school year.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="donations-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Where Your Donations Go</h2>
      <div class="split split-wide">
        <div><FundingTable /><p><small>* Our goal is to fund two enrichment experiences per grade level each year.</small></p></div>
        <div class="program-list">
          <p><strong>Enrichment Programs:</strong> Middle school is a time of exploration and discovery. PTO-funded enrichment programs bring new voices, ideas, and experiences into the classroom through assemblies, workshops, and special presentations. Our goal is to fund two enrichment experiences per grade level each year.</p>
          <p><strong>Teacher Stipends:</strong> Every teacher deserves access to tools that help students thrive. The SMS PTO provides stipends for classroom resources that may not be covered by the school budget, such as subscriptions, teaching materials, technology, and other educational tools. With approximately 80 teachers at SMS, our goal is to provide a $100 stipend to every teacher who requests one.</p>
          <p><strong>Gratitude &amp; Appreciation:</strong> Our teachers and staff invest tremendous time, energy, and care into supporting students. This fund helps us provide appreciation lunches, Teacher Appreciation Week activities, and other expressions of gratitude throughout the year.</p>
          <p><strong>Wish List Fund:</strong> This fund allows the PTO to support emerging opportunities and priorities identified by students, staff, and the community.</p>
          <p><strong>Community Activities:</strong> Middle school isn't just about students—it's also about creating connections among families. This fund helps support community-building events such as family activities and parent gatherings.</p>
          <p><strong>Family Assistance Fund:</strong> Every student should have the opportunity to participate. This fund helps offset costs for families who may need assistance accessing PTO-supported activities.</p>
          <p><strong>Save the Day Fund:</strong> Sometimes unexpected needs arise. Whether replacing a broken staff refrigerator or addressing another urgent need, this fund allows the PTO to respond quickly when timing matters.</p>
          <p><strong>Administration:</strong> To operate effectively, the PTO maintains tools and resources such as website hosting, event signage, and hospitality supplies. These investments help our volunteers maximize their impact.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="matching-section" id="matching">
    <div class="container matching-grid">
      <div class="matching-intro">
        <h2>Double Your Impact Through Corporate Matching</h2>
        <p>Many employers offer matching gift programs that can double—or even triple—the value of your donation. A $25 donation can become $50. A $50 donation can become $100 or more.</p>
        <p>It's one of the easiest ways to increase your impact and help us reach our fundraising goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="matching-steps">
        <p>Here’s how it usually works:</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Make a donation to the SMS PTO.</li>
          <li>Contact your company's HR department or go to your company’s HR website to find out if corporate gift matching is available. You can also <a href="https://doublethedonation.com/matching-gift-search#dd-container">search for your company here</a>.</li>
          <li>Double or triple your gift simply by filling out a a short matching gift form with your company's HR department. You may need to include the below information on the form:
            <div class="match-info">
              <strong>Formal Name of Organization:</strong> SHARON MIDDLE SCHOOL PARENT TEACHER ORGANIZATION INC<br />
              <strong>Address:</strong> 75 Mountain St., Sharon MA 02067<br />
              <strong>Contact for Donations:</strong> David Straus Treasurer<br />
              <strong>EIN:</strong> 20-8448543<br />
              <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:smspto@sharonschools.net">smspto@sharonschools.net</a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>Any additional donations to the SMS PTO can also be corporate matched.</li>
          <li>Your company will contact the SMS PTO Treasurer to send the additional donation.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>For more information contact the treasurers at <a href="mailto:smspto@sharonschools.net">smspto@sharonschools.net</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="membership-section" id="membership">
    <div class="membership-wrap">
      <h2 class="membership-title">Become a PTO member</h2>
      <div class="membership-grid">
        <div class="membership-card">
        <h3>Join today*</h3>
        <p class="lead">We recognize that every family's situation is different and are grateful for contributions at any level. Every gift helps strengthen our school community.</p>
        <p>Click below and fill in the amount you wish to gift. Please include your full name, and the PTO membership level in the note.</p>
        <a class="button" href="https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/sms-pto-membership" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Get a PTO Membership</a>
        <p class="membership-note">* Joining PTO does not mean you are donating your time or that you need to attend meetings.</p>
          <h4>Support by Grade Level</h4>
          <p>Come on classes, help us reach our goal! The numbers below reflects number of families who have donated to date by class.</p>
          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat"><strong>50</strong>6th Grade Families</div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>47</strong>8th Grade Families</div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>48</strong>7th Grade Families</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="membership-card">
          <h3>Membership levels</h3>
          <p>In researching comparable middle school PTOs, we found that many organizations ask families to contribute approximately $75 annually to support enrichment programs, teacher resources, community events, and student opportunities.</p>
          <p>When <a href="#matching">combined with corporate matching</a>, a $75 donation can become $150 or more in support for SMS students, teachers, and families.</p>
          <table class="funding-table levels">
            <thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Impact</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>$25 Eagle Friend</td><td>Help fund in-school enrichment for 1 student</td></tr>
              <tr><td>$50 Eagle Supporter</td><td>Listed above + appreciation lunch for 2 teachers</td></tr>
              <tr><td>$75 Soaring Eagle</td><td>Listed above + support community activities</td></tr>
              <tr><td>$100 Golden Eagle</td><td>Funds 1 teacher stipend for classroom supplies</td></tr>
              <tr><td>$200 Eagle Champion</td><td>Supports a community building event</td></tr>
              <tr><td>$500+ Eagle Legacy</td><td>Help fund in-school enrichment for students</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .support-hero { height: 336px; background: var(--burgundy); }
  .support-hero-grid { width: 100%; max-width: none; height: 336px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 427px 1fr; }
  .support-copy { padding: 40px 110px 24px 130px; color: #fff; background: var(--burgundy); }
  .support-copy .display-title { width: 598px; color: var(--gold); }
  .support-copy .lead { margin: 1.25rem 0 0; }
  .support-copy p { width: 598px; }
  .support-hero img { order: -1; width: 427px; height: 336px; object-fit: cover; }
  .support-enrichment { height: 374px; padding: 40px 0; background: #e8e6e6; }
  .enrichment-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 347px 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .support-enrichment .button-row { margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .support-enrichment .button { min-width: 244px; color: #fff; background: #6b0801; border-color: #6b0801; }
  .support-enrichment .lead { font-size: 1rem; }
  .support-enrichment p { margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .donations-section { height: 957px; padding: 42px 0; background: #fff; }
  .donations-section .split { grid-template-columns: 347px 1fr; gap: 43px; }
  .program-list p { margin: 0 0 .95rem; }
  ol { padding-left: 1.3rem; }
  ol li { margin: .8rem 0; }
  .matching-section { height: 661px; padding: 42px 0; background: #e8e6e6; }
  .matching-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 360px 539px; gap: 38px; }
  .matching-intro h2 { margin: 0 0 1.8rem; color: var(--burgundy); font-family: 'Calistoga', Georgia, serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; }
  .matching-intro p { font-weight: 700; }
  .matching-steps { padding-top: 7px; }
  .matching-steps > p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .matching-steps ol { margin: 0; }
  .matching-steps li { padding-left: .2rem; margin: 1.25rem 0; }
  .match-info { margin-top: 1.3rem; }
  .membership-section { height: 802px; padding: 34px 0; color: #000; background: #fff; }
  .membership-wrap { width: 940px; margin-inline: auto; }
  .membership-title { margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--burgundy); font-family: 'Calistoga', Georgia, serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; }
  .membership-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 460px 460px; gap: 20px; }
  .membership-card { min-height: 650px; padding: 22px 27px; border: 1px solid var(--burgundy); }
  .membership-card h3 { margin: 0 0 1.4rem; font-family: 'Lulo Clean', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .membership-card h4 { margin: 1.7rem 0 .65rem; color: var(--burgundy); font-family: 'Calistoga', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; }
  .membership-card .lead { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .membership-card .button { display: block; width: 262px; margin: 1.6rem auto 2rem; text-align: center; }
  .membership-note { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .86rem; }
  .membership-card .stats { margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .membership-card .stat { padding: 1rem .3rem; font-size: .78rem; }
  .levels td:first-child { font-weight: 700; }
  .levels tbody tr:last-child { background: transparent; }
  .levels { table-layout: fixed; margin-top: 1.8rem; font-size: 14px; }
  .levels th:first-child, .levels td:first-child { width: 160px; }
  .levels th:last-child, .levels td:last-child { text-align: left; white-space: normal; }
  .levels th, .levels td { padding: .34rem .5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .support-hero, .support-hero-grid, .support-enrichment, .donations-section, .matching-section, .membership-section { height: auto; }
    .support-hero-grid, .enrichment-grid, .donations-section .split, .matching-grid, .membership-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .matching-grid, .membership-wrap { width: min(100% - 40px, var(--max)); }
    .support-copy { padding: 36px; }
    .support-copy .display-title, .support-copy p { width: auto; }
    .support-hero img { width: 100%; }
    .support-hero img { height: 360px; }
    .support-enrichment, .donations-section, .matching-section, .membership-section { padding: 54px 0; }
    .membership-card { min-height: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .support-copy { padding: 28px 22px; } }
</style>
